1
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:33,840
Hello?

2
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,439
Sang Luo.

3
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,639
I have something for you.

4
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:38,680
Let's meet.

5
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,439
Okay.

6
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:41,360
Got it.

7
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:45,879
Then I'll...

8
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,800
Go ahead.

9
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,400
Okay.

10
00:03:59,039 --> 00:03:59,840
Wait.

11
00:04:35,199 --> 00:04:36,439
I was afraid you'd get tired in heels,

12
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,920
so I brought you a pair of flats.

13
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,920
Go ahead.

14
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:14,800
What is it?

15
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,879
You should see what's in here.

16
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,639
I happened to see this at the winery that day.

17
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,399
Actually, Lin Wanmei's lover

18
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,480
was never Cheng An.

19
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,160
It was someone else.

20
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,959
And when you had the accident three years ago,

21
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,639
Cheng An wasn't even there.

22
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,720
He was urgently sent to Seoul.

23
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,560
So he was never involved in framing you.

24
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,319
I've known all along.

25
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,279
I just didn't want to tell you.

26
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,480
So Cheng An was never

27
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,959
with Lin Wanmei either.

28
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:56,959
Yes.

29
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,639
You knew all along.

30
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,199
I did.

31
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,959
So for these past three years,

32
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,959
you watched me suffer every day,

33
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,759
but still chose to lie to me

34
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,279
and never told me the truth.

35
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,959
Yi Kai,

36
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,319
thank you for your honesty today.

37
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,199
I heard everything.

38
00:06:55,759 --> 00:06:57,360
Do you really hate me right now?

39
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:59,720
For keeping you and Sang Luo apart for three years.

40
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,000
All these years,

41
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,519
you've been misleading Xiaowei,

42
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:05,920
turning her against me.

43
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,720
But without you these past three years,

44
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,519
she would've had a much harder time.

45
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,360
I won't dwell on these past grievances.

46
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,800
But,

47
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,160
from now on, I'll be the one protecting Xiaowei.

48
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,279
So stop bothering her.

49
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:28,240
Whether or not you had an affair with Lin Wanmei,

50
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:29,639
three years ago,

51
00:07:29,639 --> 00:07:30,920
you failed to protect her.

52
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,600
You're the one who lost her once.

53
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,000
You have no right to stand by her side anymore.

54
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,399
You once told me

55
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,240
that although roses are beautiful,

56
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,199
they have an unyielding pride.

57
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,879
Since the day I fell in love with you,

58
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:30,199
I started

59
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:32,279
planting these roses every day.

60
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,360
I'm sorry.

61
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,360
I shouldn't have followed you,

62
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:45,039
or eavesdropped on your talk with Yi Kai.

63
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,919
I know you must be filled with hatred now.

64
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:49,600
But

65
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,720
I won't ask you to let it go.

66
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,000
I just want you to give me one more chance

67
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:59,159
to stand by your side.

68
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,039
I know

69
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,039
we've had too many misunderstandings

70
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:07,519
and pain in the past.

71
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:11,720
I want to spend the rest of my life making amends.

72
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,120
We can't get the past back,

73
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,039
so

74
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,360
I don't want to miss your future.

75
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:23,480
Give it to me!

76
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,240
Give it!

77
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,080
I already told you,

78
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,279
I don't have any money left!

79
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,679
What more do you want from me?

80
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,799
I've given you everything I had.

81
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:33,519
You run such a huge spa,

82
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,320
and you're telling me you're broke?

83
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:37,480
Are you fucking keeping another man?

84
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,799
I'm not!

85
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,039
Baby,

86
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,480
don't forget,

87
00:10:42,919 --> 00:10:45,399
I'm the only one who still loves your original face.

88
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,679
If they find out you're a plastic surgery freak,

89
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,399
they'll dump you without hesitation.

90
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,360
Go.

91
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,759
Get the money ready for me.

92
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,799
I'll be waiting for your good news.

93
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,279
Luoluo.

94
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,799
What brings you here?

95
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,360
That guy just now...

96
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:26,759
is he the one who cost you 300,000 in plastic surgery fees,

97
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:28,559
the scumbag who almost made you jump off a building?

98
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,360
Why are you still mixed up with him?

99
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,720
I don't know.

100
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:36,240
Maybe because he was the only one

101
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,519
who ever treated me well.

102
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,799
Are you stupid?

103
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:43,559
You're beautiful and poised,

104
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,200
and you shine so brightly.

105
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:46,480
Xia Xia,

106
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:48,879
you deserve better!

107
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:50,240
Break it off with him immediately.

108
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,039
You hear me?

109
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,000
Got it.

110
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,159
So the one with Lin Wanmei...

111
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,440
has always been Zhou Yucheng.

112
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,200
You guys misunderstood Cheng An.

113
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,840
He's helped me a lot.

114
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,000
And if it weren't for him,

115
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,759
I might already be dead.

116
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,279
Where are you?

117
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,440
I'm at Luo Xia's spa.

118
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,879
I'll come pick you up now.

119
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,919
Let's have dinner tonight.

120
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,840
Are you and Cheng An...

121
00:12:32,639 --> 00:12:34,039
getting back together?

122
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:38,559
Let's go.

123
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,360
Let's go eat.

124
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,559
How did you get here so fast?

125
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,600
Look at those two.

126
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,480
The suit,

127
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,120
the tie,

128
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:51,519
the shirt, they're exactly the same.

129
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,519
Let me see.

130
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:05,480
See?

131
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:07,159
He really looks like Zhou Yucheng.

132
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:09,519
If Mr. Cheng became a celebrity,

133
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:11,440
maybe he could be his stand-in.

134
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:13,440
Stand-in.

135
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,360
Stand-in.

136
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,879
Mr. Cheng.

137
00:13:26,879 --> 00:13:27,639
Here you go.

138
00:13:28,039 --> 00:13:28,840
Thank you.

139
00:13:30,039 --> 00:13:31,200
And this is for Ms. Sang.

140
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:36,519
Welcome to my place for a wine tasting, Mr. Cheng and Ms. Sang.

141
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,519
This is a wine I particularly like.

142
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,120
A three-year-old sweet white.

143
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,960
It uses late-harvest white grapes,

144
00:13:42,399 --> 00:13:44,559
fully extracting their rich sweetness.

145
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:46,159
When drinking it,

146
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:47,799
you can add some ice to dilute it.

147
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,759
It makes it more refreshing on the palate.

148
00:13:50,639 --> 00:13:51,960
I really like this wine too.

149
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,559
If you add just the right amount of lime juice,

150
00:13:55,159 --> 00:13:56,799
it really brings out the sweet white's aroma.

151
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,559
I didn't expect Mr. Cheng and I to have such similar tastes.

152
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,480
I'd say it's more than just similar tastes.

153
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,399
Your sense of style is very similar too.

154
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,519
Matching ties.

155
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,120
And your cologne is probably the same too, right?

156
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:14,240
Terre Cologne.

157
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:18,919
Ms. Sang's senses are very sharp.

158
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,240
Well, winemaking

159
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,840
and perfumery have a lot in common.

160
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,559
If I couldn't even smell this,

161
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,879
how could I be a winemaker at Gufeng?

162
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,559
Wouldn't you agree,

163
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:30,360
Mr. Zhou?

164
00:14:30,879 --> 00:14:31,679
Yes.

165
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,600
They are indeed two similar crafts.

166
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:37,039
No wonder I feel like Mr. Zhou and I have

167
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,440
an instant connection.

168
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,120
By the way,

169
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:40,879
Mr. Zhou,

170
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,639
your clothes and cologne...

171
00:14:42,639 --> 00:14:44,080
did you choose them yourself, or

172
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,639
did your girlfriend pick them out for you?

173
00:14:46,399 --> 00:14:47,200
Well...

174
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,200
Please feel free to look around.

175
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,440
Excuse me for a moment.

176
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,240
Okay.

177
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:08,200
Doesn't Zhou Yucheng's wine seem familiar?

178
00:15:09,039 --> 00:15:09,840
Exactly.

179
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,879
He seems to like refreshing flavors.

180
00:15:13,279 --> 00:15:14,399
Lin Wanmei's wine

181
00:15:14,879 --> 00:15:17,320
is very similar in style to his.

182
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:20,200
It's not just similar.

183
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,039
It's a bait-and-switch.

184
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:35,799
Hello.

185
00:15:35,799 --> 00:15:36,799
I'm looking for Ms. Lin Wanmei.

186
00:15:36,799 --> 00:15:37,440
Just a moment, please.

187
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,840
I'll let Ms. Lin know.

188
00:15:39,159 --> 00:15:40,120
May I have your name?

189
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,080
I'm a friend of hers.

190
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,159
Zhou Yucheng.

191
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,320
Hello, Ms. Lin.

192
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,200
Cheng An's taste just keeps getting better.

193
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:04,799
What the hell are you doing?

194
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:06,559
I missed you.

195
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,120
Didn't I tell you?

196
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,879
Not to show up at the office unannounced.

197
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,120
I just got here today,

198
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:20,960
and someone already mistook me for Cheng An.

199
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,279
This isn't the first time.

200
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:25,039
I don't know what you're talking about.

201
00:16:27,159 --> 00:16:28,039
I get it now.

202
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,759
Your little stand-in game...

203
00:16:32,399 --> 00:16:33,600
I'm not playing it anymore.

204
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,559
What stand-in?

205
00:16:34,559 --> 00:16:35,799
What nonsense are you talking about?

206
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,480
The clothes you make me wear,

207
00:16:37,559 --> 00:16:38,639
the ties you make me put on,

208
00:16:38,799 --> 00:16:40,000
the cologne you make me spray...

209
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,399
They're exactly like his.

210
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,840
To think I, Zhou Yucheng, have become

211
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,000
someone else's shadow.

212
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:48,759
Lin Wanmei,

213
00:16:50,679 --> 00:16:52,840
do I even have a place in your heart?

214
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:00,080
The fact that Cheng An is my past,

215
00:17:00,799 --> 00:17:02,399
I have never hidden from you.

216
00:17:03,559 --> 00:17:05,000
My situation in the Cheng family,

217
00:17:05,799 --> 00:17:07,000
you're also fully aware of.

218
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:10,759
These clothes, colognes, and ties...

219
00:17:11,519 --> 00:17:12,759
It's just because I saw them

220
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:14,039
and thought you might like them too,

221
00:17:14,039 --> 00:17:15,200
so I bought them.

222
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:16,920
But I never expected

223
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:18,640
that because of a few words from others,

224
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,000
you'd question my sincerity.

225
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:21,920
The way you distrust me

226
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,119
is truly heartbreaking.

227
00:17:25,599 --> 00:17:27,160
If this is your attitude,

228
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:29,920
if you want to break up with me over this...

229
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,000
Fine.

230
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,319
I'll give you what you want.

231
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,480
I'm sorry.

232
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:43,319
Wanmei.

233
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:45,400
I shouldn't have doubted you.

234
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,759
Have you been having trouble sleeping lately, Wanmei?

235
00:18:07,839 --> 00:18:09,319
You look a bit tired.

236
00:18:10,319 --> 00:18:11,599
I've been suffering from insomnia lately.

237
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:12,680
I can't sleep well.

238
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,240
Our store just got some new Calming Incense.

239
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:17,119
It helps relieve fatigue

240
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,200
and relax the mind.

241
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:20,240
Shall I light some for you?

242
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,039
No need.

243
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,559
I don't like that sort of thing.

244
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,640
What are you doing?

245
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,440
Wanmei.

246
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,000
I saw you were asleep,

247
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,279
and was afraid you'd drop your phone,

248
00:18:45,279 --> 00:18:46,880
so I thought I'd set it aside for you.

249
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,480
Wanmei,

250
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:55,960
I noticed quite a few fine lines around your eyes.

251
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:56,960
Look.

252
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,200
See?

253
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,799
Our salon has a soothing essential oil.

254
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,559
Applying a hot towel

255
00:19:04,599 --> 00:19:06,359
can relieve your eye fatigue.

256
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,000
Paired with an eye massage,

257
00:19:08,119 --> 00:19:09,599
it can help fade your fine lines.

258
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:10,680
Would you like to give it a try?

259
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,200
Wanmei,

260
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:30,200
is this pressure okay?

261
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,000
Wanmei

262
00:19:47,319 --> 00:19:48,119
Wanmei

263
00:20:45,319 --> 00:20:46,319
This batch of wine...

264
00:20:46,319 --> 00:20:47,680
How did it run out so quickly?

265
00:20:48,039 --> 00:20:50,480
We gave away a lot of wine for the store anniversary.

266
00:20:50,839 --> 00:20:52,119
The feedback has been great.

267
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,799
Even President Lin was full of praise.

268
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,000
Really?

269
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,359
The wine you requested

270
00:20:56,359 --> 00:20:57,680
is already in the warehouse.

271
00:20:58,559 --> 00:20:59,480
Please check it.

272
00:20:59,559 --> 00:21:00,279
Okay.

273
00:21:00,279 --> 00:21:01,279
If there's nothing else,

274
00:21:01,279 --> 00:21:02,079
I'll get going now.

275
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,599
Are you busy later?

276
00:21:08,599 --> 00:21:09,480
I need a favor from you.

277
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,319
I'm free.

278
00:21:10,319 --> 00:21:11,039
Go ahead.

279
00:21:11,319 --> 00:21:12,039
Okay.

280
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:12,799
Wait a moment.

281
00:21:15,559 --> 00:21:17,720
I have a prized bottle of wine from a friend.

282
00:21:17,839 --> 00:21:19,920
I'd like you to help taste it, Mr. Zhou.

283
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,200
Of course, no problem.

284
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:27,920
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry.

285
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,519
Let me wipe that for you.

286
00:21:30,079 --> 00:21:30,480
I can do it myself.

287
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:30,759
Thanks.

288
00:21:30,759 --> 00:21:31,720
It's okay, let me wipe it.

289
00:21:32,039 --> 00:21:33,680
There are spare clothes in the lounge.

290
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,960
Why don't you go change first?

291
00:21:35,519 --> 00:21:35,880
Okay.

292
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:36,559
Thank you.

293
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,039
Grandma.

294
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:03,440
We got a call from abroad.

295
00:22:03,799 --> 00:22:06,519
They said Second Uncle is doing fine there.

296
00:22:07,079 --> 00:22:08,480
Don't mention that disgrace to me.

297
00:22:10,079 --> 00:22:12,799
I know you've always cared about him, Grandma.

298
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:14,240
I'm telling you this

299
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:18,079
so you can worry a little less.

300
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,200
Look,

301
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:22,079
