303
00:22:26,599 --> 00:22:27,480
Not at all.

304
00:22:27,839 --> 00:22:29,599
You're just too tired lately.

305
00:22:31,079 --> 00:22:31,920
Over at Qixia Mountain,

306
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:33,839
