307
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:36,680
Why don't I take you there to relax?

308
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:40,519
You're always so thoughtful.

309
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:47,880
Grandma,

310
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,319
I've already booked the room.

311
00:22:49,319 --> 00:22:50,799
We'll go eat first,

312
00:22:50,799 --> 00:22:52,160
and then go to the hot springs.

313
00:22:52,519 --> 00:22:53,599
And let me tell you,

314
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:56,039
I bought you a really sexy swimsuit.

315
00:22:56,279 --> 00:22:57,519
What sexy swimsuit?

316
00:22:57,519 --> 00:23:00,519
I'd look ridiculous at my age.

317
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:02,119
Of course not.

318
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,559
You have such a great figure, Grandma.

319
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:06,359
Plus, they really value privacy here.

320
00:23:06,519 --> 00:23:09,000
We'll be in our own room for the hot springs.

321
00:23:09,119 --> 00:23:11,039
It's also perfect for couples,

322
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:12,519
or having an affair.

323
00:23:14,079 --> 00:23:15,039
Young lady,

324
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,839
you really have no filter.

325
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:20,319
I'm going to the restroom first.

326
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,440
Here's the room key.

327
00:23:27,359 --> 00:23:28,160
Grandma,

328
00:23:28,279 --> 00:23:29,759
I'm starving.

329
00:23:30,039 --> 00:23:31,039
Okay, okay, okay.

330
00:23:31,759 --> 00:23:32,960
Let's go eat first.

331
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:34,400
Let's go.

332
00:23:45,480 --> 00:23:46,759
Nothing will ever happen again

333
00:23:46,759 --> 00:23:47,880
to make you sad.

334
00:23:55,519 --> 00:23:57,119
Can I really trust you again?

335
00:23:58,319 --> 00:23:59,119
Of course.

336
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:08,880
I love you.

337
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:25,920
Which way?

338
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:29,200
Grandma.

339
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:29,720
What's wrong?

340
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,119
I think I sprained my ankle.

341
00:24:31,119 --> 00:24:32,240
Let me see. Let me see.

342
00:24:33,519 --> 00:24:34,720
Let Grandma rub it for you.

343
00:24:35,359 --> 00:24:36,200
Better?

344
00:24:36,799 --> 00:24:37,559
A little better.

345
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:37,920
Grandma.

346
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,880
Walk carefully then.

347
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:40,559
Okay.

348
00:24:41,119 --> 00:24:42,119
Let Grandma help you.

349
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:43,920
Take it slow.

350
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:44,279
Slowly.

351
00:24:45,119 --> 00:24:45,920
It still hurts.

352
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:48,799
Fire alarm!

353
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:50,960
Fire!

354
00:24:54,039 --> 00:24:54,839
Fire!

355
00:24:56,759 --> 00:24:57,559
Fire!

356
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,039
My shoes.

357
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:02,440
Forget them!

358
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,079
There's no time!

359
00:25:03,079 --> 00:25:03,559
It's okay, Grandma.

360
00:25:03,559 --> 00:25:04,400
Everyone's running!

361
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,359
W-We...

362
00:25:05,599 --> 00:25:06,559
Let's keep moving forward.

363
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:08,799
Careful, careful.

364
00:25:09,079 --> 00:25:10,400
Scared me to death. I didn't even grab my shoes.

365
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:11,279
Let's just get out of here.

366
00:25:14,119 --> 00:25:15,039
Aunt Lin.

367
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:17,720
Lin Wanmei.

368
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:19,880
Aunt Lin!

369
00:25:20,079 --> 00:25:21,079
You bitch!

370
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:23,480
Lin Wanmei!

371
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,079
Let's go! Let's go!

372
00:25:24,079 --> 00:25:25,039
What are you doing?

373
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:27,799
You!

374
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,799
You shameless wretch!

375
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:47,000
You've completely disgraced the Cheng family!

376
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,640
How long has it been since Cheng Feng passed?

377
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:49,440
And you're already doing this.

378
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:50,720
How could you do this to him?

379
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:52,480
Madam Cheng,

380
00:25:52,519 --> 00:25:53,519
