381
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:54,160
I'm the one who likes her.

382
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:54,920
I was pestering her.

383
00:25:55,279 --> 00:25:56,480
Shut up!

384
00:25:57,319 --> 00:25:58,640
Who the hell do you think you are?

385
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:01,000
Lin Wanmei,

386
00:26:01,519 --> 00:26:02,759
