387
00:26:03,759 --> 00:26:04,799
You and this man...

388
00:26:05,359 --> 00:26:07,119
When did you two hook up?

389
00:26:08,599 --> 00:26:09,640
This is the first time.

390
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:12,839
Aunt Lin,

391
00:26:13,519 --> 00:26:16,119
