395
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:30,960
Oh, my dear Feng!

396
00:26:31,119 --> 00:26:32,519
My poor, ill-fated child!

397
00:26:32,519 --> 00:26:33,680
While you were still alive,

398
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,920
this woman had already started

399
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:37,160
