400
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:39,839
I'll beat you shameless creatures to death!

401
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:42,960
Cheng An,

402
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:45,119
are you still going to protect this vixen?

403
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,279
Lin Wanmei,

404
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:55,559
before you married into the Cheng family,

405
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:58,359
