406
00:26:58,759 --> 00:26:59,960
If, after marriage,

407
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,799
you do anything to betray him,

408
00:27:01,799 --> 00:27:03,240
it will automatically revoke

409
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:06,480
all rights you obtained as Mrs. Cheng.

410
00:27:06,599 --> 00:27:08,119
I'll have a lawyer contact you

411
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:10,319
to take back the shares belonging to the Cheng family.

412
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:11,319
As for

413
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,440
the rights you obtained in Gufeng Group,

414
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,119
we will use legal means

415
00:27:15,119 --> 00:27:16,039
to recover them from you.

416
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,359
Feng left those to me!

417
00:27:18,440 --> 00:27:19,799
What right do you have to take them?

418
00:27:20,519 --> 00:27:21,279
My brother thought you were

419
00:27:21,279 --> 00:27:22,920
someone he could entrust his life to.

420
00:27:23,119 --> 00:27:23,960
And you?

421
00:27:24,359 --> 00:27:25,839
Look at what you've done.

422
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:27,960
But don't worry.

423
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:30,119
No matter what it takes,

424
00:27:31,359 --> 00:27:33,519
I will seek justice for my brother.

425
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:36,839
You...

426
00:27:37,119 --> 00:27:38,480
You filthy pair!

427
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:40,200
Get the hell out of the Cheng family!

428
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:42,319
Don't you dare ruin the Cheng family anymore!

429
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:46,920
Me, ruin the Cheng family?

430
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:49,519
Fang Liangxi,

431
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:52,119
when it comes to sinners who ruin the Cheng family,

432
00:27:52,119 --> 00:27:53,799
I'm no match for you.

433
00:27:54,839 --> 00:27:56,000
At your age,

434
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:56,640
you're still looking for men.

435
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:59,079
For the sake of that unborn child in your belly,

436
00:27:59,079 --> 00:28:00,559
you'd even abandon

437
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:02,759
your own son whom you raised for over thirty years!

438
00:28:03,039 --> 00:28:04,200
Aren't you afraid that old Mr. Cheng

439
00:28:04,200 --> 00:28:05,759
will come for you in the middle of the night?

440
00:28:05,759 --> 00:28:06,400
You!

441
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,720
Get the hell out of here!

442
00:28:19,799 --> 00:28:20,640
It was you!

443
00:28:21,119 --> 00:28:22,400
You're the one who brought this vixen

444
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:23,680
into this house!

445
00:28:23,799 --> 00:28:24,599
You!

446
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:26,279
You're just a Jinx!

447
00:28:40,960 --> 00:28:41,759
Wanmei.

448
00:28:42,519 --> 00:28:43,519
What are you going to do?

449
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,799
Knowing Madam Cheng's personality,

450
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:49,079
she won't just let this go.

451
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:52,279
I've already left the Cheng family.

452
00:28:52,559 --> 00:28:53,920
What more can she do to me?

453
00:28:55,799 --> 00:28:56,599
Wanmei.

454
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,599
I'm worried she'll target you at Gufeng.

455
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,039
Come with me.

456
00:29:00,279 --> 00:29:02,759
Let's go abroad, away from all this mess.

457
00:29:03,480 --> 00:29:04,279
Leave?

458
00:29:06,759 --> 00:29:08,960
I've bowed and scraped in the Cheng family for so many years.

459
00:29:09,559 --> 00:29:10,960
The things I finally managed to get,

460
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,279
what right do they have to take them?

461
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,720
Yucheng.

462
00:29:15,599 --> 00:29:16,920
I, Lin Wanmei, can suffer,

463
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:17,920
and I can be exhausted,

464
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,440
but I will absolutely not become a joke.

465
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:26,440
I haven't played my last card yet.

466
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:28,680
Who wins and who loses

467
00:29:29,279 --> 00:29:30,559
is yet to be seen.

468
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:35,000
Can someone like Lin Wanmei

469
00:29:36,119 --> 00:29:37,720
even have a heart?

470
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:47,680
Let me see your face.

471
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,359
Does the slap still hurt?

472
00:29:51,559 --> 00:29:52,640
Your mom treats you like that,

473
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:54,000
and you still put up with it.

474
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:54,960
Isn't that a bit...

475
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:55,960
She's not my real mom.

476
00:29:57,359 --> 00:29:58,160
What?
